+ * athlete, plus variants and a group photograph:
+ *
+ *   <id>_portrait   head and shoulders, studio backdrop, 512x512
+ *   <id>_headgear   the headwear's own hero angle (profile, rear...), 512x512
+ *   <id>_idle       full body in the arena, a different frame of 'At Rest' each
+ *   <id>_action     full body in the arena, a clip frame matched to personality
+ *   variant_*       headgear alternatives for an art pick
+ *   group_rainbow   the whole roster lined up at centre court
+ *
+ * POSES are sampled from the character's own animation clips through a
+ * private AnimationMixer on the kinematic ghost, and the ragdoll's visual
+ * groups are posed from the ghost exactly the way the tracker computes its
+ * targets (boneWorld * inv(bindBoneWorld) * bindBodyWorld). The ghost's bone
+ * locals are snapshotted before and restored after every shot.
+ *
+ * RENDER-ONLY. This module never writes to a Rapier body, a velocity or a
